  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/505704/diamond-spheres-invention-and-ingenuity?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Invention &amp; Ingenuity</a></sup></p>\n<p>Allies within the area of your <em>pathing</em> reduce any forced movement they are subject to from physical sources (such as a bull rush combat maneuver) by 5 feet + 5 feet per 10 associated ranks.</p>\n<p>Such allies can spend an immediate action to double this forced movement reduction–if this would reduce the forced movement to 0 feet, the ally can move 5 feet as part of this action (which does not provoke attacks of opportunity).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc49\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
